<189>Jul 26 2026 09:14:23 MY-KL-HQ-CORE: %SEC-6-IPACCESSLOGP: list GUEST-CONTAINMENT denied tcp 10.10.30.147(52414) -> 10.10.10.15(22), 3 packets
